-## What the zones mean
-
-`GET /api/map/areas/:areaId` returns aggregated fictional seed data only, with no narratives,
-reporter identities, or private user submissions. Only Braamfontein has mapped demo data.
-Other supported suburbs return empty snapshots. Unknown area IDs return 404 and database
-failures return 503. Legacy seeds work without a database migration: the server matches
-known demo landmark descriptions to explicitly approximate geographic centres.
-
